"{doc}`../guides/user/index` nell'ordine, e {doc}`../reference/configuration/index` "
"quando ti stancherai delle righe di comando lunghe."

#: ../../source/overview/index.md:52
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Supporting a report nobody supports yet.** {doc}`../guides/formats/tutorials/first-"
